### Valid status values (canonical)

- `open` — approved/queued; work not actively executing.
- `in-progress` — active execution is underway.
- `blocked` — execution cannot proceed due to dependency/approval/incident.
- `completed` — execution finished and required evidence is recorded.

When this job is registered in `operations/tasks.json`, set `status_source_strategy` explicitly:

- `doc_enforced` — keep task/path/docs/dashboard status in sync (default).
- `ssot_only` — treat `operations/tasks.json` as authoritative and skip doc/dashboard checks for that task.

